引，但再往下看，就会见到黑色的鳞片一路延伸，化作长长的蛇尾。她一动，发丝分开，露出一张清瘦而美丽的脸庞，颧骨高耸，双唇丰润。然而，纵使这奇异生灵如此诱人，那蛇一般的尾巴带来的恐惧仍让你脊背发凉。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a9c6dc491511c308e1a5f4cd46a3a060039fd7e2334d211b8b6a49c2b425b20","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0856f4745e2bd6619ba6a5d258e78e84b0d38c49927d9f173627c2bc200010c8","logical_entry_identity":"ec40ba59aaac7efd5a418cf62033d3004512dc545323047189dc87a79495c52e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Physical save: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"物理豁免加成："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc6af5acf2e84c4042cd4be495f6ca1d368298b7dd2699011e83b4e19a740ff2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"08893d024fa54685f642ab3e6611a06af3b7d05508ea37b57c9bb378334a5f69","logical_entry_identity":"9eb19e794964942159a5ca6e02ad8be178072d4f68aee933a9e416beee376db4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use your %s anymore; it is tainted by magic.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你不能再使用 %s ，它已被魔法所污染。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"33c787fc4803f2f8019511ae2070e97b4829e8c817993a5652262a1083b8854c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"08da1c7af68c972d6f5708c1070c5fd11e751b574824523cf49ce477b8c2a467","logical_entry_identity":"19b8194432bed95f9ed6272d6079f2088aa5ea8da9d67a7135280f517fb237d4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"impenetrable","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"坚不可破"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"98388de427395437a028110d658109a889f79d2d792cf4faeb9920893a5607af","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"08fb7a47bedf982c17aefeaf92ff24f191e3152fd28dfdccf0bfd250707dbb99","logical_entry_identity":"cf885f0c7d03f90f81fa9e85931f6c7e531669072a4a3bc74477ffa216851781","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"acid burst (crit)","source_tag":"entity name","target":"暴击时 酸性溅射伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6afbc71349a6f15ea07262e08ab66e529a4e16e513cfce9698deed06f6c78734","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"094b347c7959e09ee3f2de22e7d29a0de36a6f9bde923cafb7519457b6f73